Reader

A paragraph that wraps onto the next line and
is joined into one row of text again. Two
spaces at the end of a line are a break.
Those were two lines.

An inline link, one with a title and a query
two, a reference, a shortcut and an implicit
reference, an https://example.org/autolink
address, a nobody@example.org one, inline code
including <angle> brackets, both kinds of
strong, both kinds of emphasis and all at once
. A star that is *not emphasis* stays a star,
snake_case_names stay themselves, and 5 < 6 &&
R&D is escaped rather than applied.

Entities arrive as themselves: & ' © while
&nope; stays literal. Raw HTML is text here:
<b>bold</b> shows its own tags.

